'''Ice Shard '''is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Winter Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended and the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made out of a large ice shard, hence the name. The guard is a snowflake faced horizontally with small, cracked icicles arising out from it. The handle is a thin, frigid ice line with a think chunk of ice as its pommel.

==Trivia==
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/188868661/Snow-Fiends-Daggers Snow Fiend's Dagger], which originated from the [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/163/Snow-Fiend Snow Fiend] bundle.
*During the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]], the statue of [[Nikilis]] in the main lobby was holding this knife.
*Ice Shard was included in the [[Winter Item Pack]] along with [[Ice Phoenix]], and the [[Blizzard (Effect)|Blizzard]] effect.
*This item did not go offsale until June 2018, when it was scheduled to go offsale directly after the [[Christmas Event 2017|Christmas 2017]] event ended.
*When salvaged, it provides 12 [[Godly Weapons|godly]] shards.
** It partners with it’s own effect, [[Blizzard (Effect)|Blizzard]].

